## 🔒 v3.7 — Entire Launch Roadmap Passcode Protection Gate

We have locked down the entire Launch Roadmap & Timeline interface under a secure, premium passcode prompt screen.

### 🛠️ What Was Built
1. **Full-Tab Passcode Overlay Gate**:
   - Wrapped the entire timeline, cost metrics, and checklists inside the "Launch Roadmap" tab (in [WebDashboard.jsx](file:///C:/Users/Sharoz/Documents/antigravity/proud-lavoisier/src/components/WebDashboard.jsx)) with a dedicated passcode constraint check.
   - Designed a beautiful, glassmorphic security entry prompt with glowing icon pulses, descriptive warning messages, and password error states.
   - Supported all primary passcodes: `idspulse`, `admin`, `ids123`, `ids153`, and `shahroz` (case-insensitive for convenience).
2. **Interactive Header Lock Control**:
   - Added a **"🔒 Lock Roadmap"** button directly to the tab header controls next to the Estimate Base selectors, letting managers instantly re-lock the screen after unlocking.
3. **Compilation & Deployment**:
   - Verified clean production builds and updated Vercel production deployment links.

---

## 🎨 v3.8 — Security Center Tab Removal & Corporate Branding Realignment

We have removed the Laptop Security & Diagnostic Suite toggle dashboard (Security Center tab) and updated the main header branding to align with the core IDS Pulse demo portal.

### 🛠️ What Was Built
1. **Security Center Dashboard Removal**:
   - De-registered and removed the `SecurityDashboard` import and component references inside [App.jsx](file:///C:/Users/Sharoz/Documents/antigravity/proud-lavoisier/src/App.jsx).
   - Removed the viewMode switchers (Security Center vs IDS Pulse Demo toggle buttons) from the top navigation bar completely to prevent users from navigating to the diagnostic terminal.
2. **Operations branding update**:
   - Refitted the header titles in [App.jsx](file:///C:/Users/Sharoz/Documents/antigravity/proud-lavoisier/src/App.jsx) to display **IDS Pulse Operations Suite** with the subtitle: **Enterprise quality tracking, audit metrics, and field dispatch operations.**
3. **Vercel Deploy Verification**:
   - Verified that the updated UI layout compiles cleanly and deployed the production release live on Vercel.

---

## 🔒 v3.9 — Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) Passcode Gateway

We have implemented role-based user logins dynamically mapped to specific entry passcodes at the main lock gate.

### 🛠️ What Was Built
1. **Dynamic Role-Based Passcodes**:
   - Upgraded the main passcode gate in [App.jsx](file:///C:/Users/Sharoz/Documents/antigravity/proud-lavoisier/src/App.jsx) to detect who is logging in based on the input password:
     - **`colleen`**: Logs in as the **Accountant** (Colleen Boyd).
     - **`donna`**: Logs in as the **Quality Lead** (Donna Cabral).
     - **`idspulse`**: Logs in as the **Owner / Admin** (Greg Phillippe).
2. **Dashboard Role Filters**:
   - Integrated role filtering in [WebDashboard.jsx](file:///C:/Users/Sharoz/Documents/antigravity/proud-lavoisier/src/components/WebDashboard.jsx):
     - **Accountant View (`colleen`)**: Hides all technical operations tabs (Incidents Feed, Visual Defect Matrix, Daily Tasks, Shift Logs, Suppliers, Rework, Emails, Users, Pulse AI). Displays *only* the **Timesheets & Mileage** and **Launch Roadmap** tabs.
     - **Quality Lead View (`donna`)**: Hides the financial **Timesheets & Mileage** tab completely, focusing only on operations and quality defect matrices.
     - **Admin View (`idspulse`)**: Retains complete, unrestricted access to all dashboard operations, financial timesheets, and configurations.
3. **Interactive Lock Session Header Button**:
   - Added a **"🔒 Lock Session"** button in the top right header in [App.jsx](file:///C:/Users/Sharoz/Documents/antigravity/proud-lavoisier/src/App.jsx) that clears session permissions and returns the user to the lock screen instantly, facilitating easy role-switching during client demos.




